Z||000009||Fformula88||06-09-2000||10:17 PM||||I had some guy in a Lumina sedan take off from a toll booth as I was to get in front of me before the highway returned to two lanes.  I had just eased into the throttle, and was surprised as this Lumina to the right was jumping away.  A few seconds later I had floored it, determined not to let him in front.  If he wanted a race, he had it.  Plus, being on the highway we had plenty of space to run it out.  I got a nose on him as the highway was narrowing and he cut in behind me.  It would not have been too close if he hadn't had that head start.  ||||reg||1
